# Adds to the repository's .swiftformat, which SwiftFormat also reads for this tree.
# FoundationMacros is swift-foundation's source, kept as upstream wrote it so it diffs against theirs.
--exclude Compat/Sources/FoundationMacros
# skipstone reads `/* SKIP @bridge */` markers only as block comments: docComments would make
# them `/** */` and blockComments `//`, and the bridge would silently lose those declarations.
--disable docComments,blockComments
# The headers here say what each stand-in approximates; the repository strips Xcode's.
--header ignore
